### Trouble for the fake data source (VS Code REST Client, Visual Studio, Rider). Backend: dotnet run --project backend/src/ObservabilityCity.Host
@host = http://localhost:5080

### High CPU on the Ledger API
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-api", "kind": "HighCpu", "intensity": 0.9 }

### Dead letters building up in the Payments worker
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay.payments-worker", "kind": "Poison", "intensity": 1 }

### Payments queue backs up
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay.payments-worker", "kind": "Backlog", "intensity": 1 }

### Ledger API down
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-api", "kind": "Down", "intensity": 1 }

### Screening API goes stale
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "frd.screening-api", "kind": "Stale", "intensity": 1 }

### Errors across the whole Payments island
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay", "kind": "Errors", "intensity": 0.6 }

### Ledger DB throttling
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-db", "kind": "Saturate", "intensity": 1 }

### One tenant's ledger database throttling (add ?env=staging to aim at another environment)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "cl.ledger-db#acme-bank", "kind": "Saturate", "intensity": 1 }

### Rain over Payments (a sev 2 incident; intensity 0.9 is sev 1 and a storm, 0.4 overcast, 0.1 clouds)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "pay", "kind": "Incident", "intensity": 0.6 }

### Credit bureau (third party) down
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "ext.credit-bureau", "kind": "Down", "intensity": 1 }

### Card network slow
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "ext.card-network", "kind": "Latency", "intensity": 0.9 }

### Airport rush (more outside callers through the gateway)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "hub.apim", "kind": "Traffic", "intensity": 0.9 }

### Whole Fraud island goes grey
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "frd", "kind": "Stale", "intensity": 1 }

### Backlog on the worker-only pillar's pier (crates pile on the quay, no bridge needed)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "rcn.matching-worker", "kind": "Backlog", "intensity": 1 }

### Dead letters on the worker-only pillar's pier (broken crates, red beam, hub lighthouse)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "rcn.matching-worker", "kind": "Poison", "intensity": 1 }

### Dead letters on the legacy egress reader in Lost & found (amber pennant on its pier)
POST {{host}}/api/fake/effects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "target": "lost-found.batch-gateway-worker", "kind": "Poison", "intensity": 1 }

### What is active
GET {{host}}/api/fake

### Reset everything
POST {{host}}/api/fake/reset
